cff-version: 0.2.2
message: "If you use this software or its data in your work, please cite it as below. / 使用本软件或其数据时请按下列格式引用。"
title: "MACKORN Hydraulic Cone Crusher Selection — NH/NS Series"
abstract: >-
  An open-source (MIT) engineering engine for hydraulic cone crusher selection,
  crushing-and-screening plant design, steady-state flow simulation and
  measured-data calibration. Exposed as 29 MCP tools for AI agents.
  Covers MACKORN NH (standard) and NS (high-speed) single-cylinder hydraulic
  cone crushers for aggregate and metal-mine crushing circuits.
